# One line ending in the repository, whatever the machine.
#
# This project is meant to be built on Windows (desktop), macOS (iOS) and
# Linux (CI). Without this, a checkout on Windows rewrites every file to CRLF
# and the next commit from a Mac shows all 9000 lines as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary

# An .ics file is read byte-for-byte by the parser tests, and RFC 5545
# requires CRLF — so these must not be normalised.
*.ics -text
